# Fixes to the hou stub that stubgen_houdini.py generates from SideFX's docs, merged in last
# (see "The hou overlay" in annotate/README.md).  A plain entry gives the stub's parameters and
# return their types; a `@replace` entry (or `@replace` `@overload` entries) replaces a
# signature the docs get wrong; a `@type_check_only` entry declares a member the docs lack.

